out.push(h2('3.6  Forty minutes'));
out.push(S('Stage 1 · Get ready'));
out.push(A('**a** Open, and the four minutes are timed by the teacher and announced. ⚠ Read the question **once**. A class that hears it twice plans for six minutes and learns nothing about the first four.'));
out.push(A('**b** **1** four minutes   **2** four   **3** twenty-four   **4** four   **5** four. Total forty. ⚠ Put the five figures on the board and leave them for the rest of the book; they are the same for every essay the class will ever write, and the Mid-Book Test allows the same forty.'));
